<Tips>
  Liv is not defeatable here, she'll kill everyone present. You're looking for a way to remove Banks from the fight, so she can return later and rez everyone else.
  You have one ability that removes someone from the fight. If you haven't read its description, you may not be aware that they eventually come back. Liv sure isn't.
  Create a Death's Door and push Banks into it. Per the ability description, she'll return an hour later. Liv will be long gone, and Banks can rez everyone else.
</Tips>

